>>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ESG-VAL.
AUTHOR. SMCPE.
REMARKS. ESG gratuity — <3y 0.33*int(y), 3-5 0.5*y, 5-10 1*y, >10 1.5*y.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-YEARS      PIC 9(02)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-FACTOR     PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-MONTHLY    PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01 WS-ACCRUAL    PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01 WS-ACCRUAL-DISP PIC ZZZZZZZZZZ9.99.
01 WS-YEARS-INT  PIC 9(04) VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-YEARS-STR   PIC X(10).
01 LS-MONTHLY-STR PIC X(15).
01 LS-ACCRUAL-STR PIC X(15).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-YEARS-STR LS-MONTHLY-STR LS-ACCRUAL-STR.
    IF FUNCTION TRIM(LS-YEARS-STR) = SPACES OR FUNCTION TRIM(LS-MONTHLY-STR) = SPACES
        MOVE "0.00" TO LS-ACCRUAL-STR
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-YEARS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(LS-YEARS-STR)
        ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 0 TO WS-YEARS END-COMPUTE
    COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY = FUNCTION NUMVAL(LS-MONTHLY-STR)
        ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 0 TO WS-MONTHLY END-COMPUTE
    IF WS-YEARS < 3
        MOVE 0.33 TO WS-FACTOR
        COMPUTE WS-YEARS-INT = FUNCTION INTEGER(WS-YEARS)
        COMPUTE WS-ACCRUAL = WS-MONTHLY * WS-FACTOR * WS-YEARS-INT
            ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 0 TO WS-ACCRUAL END-COMPUTE
    ELSE
        IF WS-YEARS < 5
            MOVE 0.50 TO WS-FACTOR
        ELSE
            IF WS-YEARS < 10
                MOVE 1.00 TO WS-FACTOR
            ELSE
                MOVE 1.50 TO WS-FACTOR
            END-IF
        END-IF
        COMPUTE WS-ACCRUAL = WS-MONTHLY * WS-FACTOR * WS-YEARS
            ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 0 TO WS-ACCRUAL END-COMPUTE
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-ACCRUAL TO WS-ACCRUAL-DISP
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ACCRUAL-DISP) TO LS-ACCRUAL-STR
    GOBACK.
